  - time: 40
    nbHumans: 10
    nbPoliceMen: 4
    nbHelicos: 0
    maskMandatory: 1
    totalLockdown: 0
    flashInfo: 'Breaking News: The President has suggested injecting disinfectant
      to kill the virus from within. While the idea is being reviewed, mask police
      has been reinforced.'
  - time: 65
    nbHumans: 5
    nbPoliceMen: 4
    nbHelicos: 0
    maskMandatory: 1
    totalLockdown: 0
    flashInfo: 'Breaking News: A lockdown has been put in place to slow down the
      epidemic. Please stay at home and follow official guidelines.'
  - time: 85
    nbHumans: 5
    nbPoliceMen: 5
    nbHelicos: 1
    maskMandatory: 1
    totalLockdown: 0
    flashInfo: 'Breaking News: A police helicopter is currently patrolling the area
      to check mask-wearing. The President assures that the situation is prefectly
      under control.'
  - time: 105
    nbHumans: 5
    nbPoliceMen: 7
    nbHelicos: 2
    maskMandatory: 1
    totalLockdown: 0
    flashInfo: 'Breaking News: The President suggested the virus may be sensitive
      to waves. His proposal for human-sized microwaves was rejected by the Security
      Council, and mask police forces have been reinforced.'
  - time: 130
    nbHumans: 0
    nbPoliceMen: 7
    nbHelicos: 2
    maskMandatory: 1
    totalLockdown: 1
    flashInfo: 'Breaking News: A full day-and-night curfew has been imposed to definitively
      stop the epidemic. Yes, even during the day. Good luck.'
  - time: 150
    nbHumans: 0
    nbPoliceMen: 10
    nbHelicos: 3
    maskMandatory: 1
    totalLockdown: 1
    flashInfo: 'Breaking News: The President claims that if re-elected, he will end
      the epidemic in just two weeks. Meanwhile, mask police forces have been reinforced.'
  - time: 180
    nbHumans: 0
    nbPoliceMen: 14
    nbHelicos: 3
    maskMandatory: 1
    totalLockdown: 1
    flashInfo: 'Breaking News: Authorities have reinforced police forces, reaffirming
      that police remains the go-to solution for all known problems.'
